        <div class="frame-service-desc">
            <h3>Social Events & Weddings</h3>
            <p class="frame-service-text">
                We are yet to be sure if marriages are made in heaven, but we certainly have managed many of them, here on Earth. At MICE Hospitality, one of core strengths is the value to put on human bonds. Hence right from designing the event, planning, and creating awe-inspiring luxurious weddings and social events anywhere in this country, you can count on us. It is such a passionate feeling to help create moments that few look back to with the greatest happiness in their hearts. For the families, for the guests and most importantly for the couple getting hitched for a lifetime. <br /><br />
                Go on, make a wish, and let us know. We promise that we will put in more than the best of us for the perfect moment of your life.
            </p>
